hpc:Host a owl:Class .
hpc:Fieldname a owl:Class .
hpc:Alias a owl:Class .
hpc:width a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:Unit a owl:Class .
hpc:bhosts a owl:ObjectProperty .

hpc:Host rdfs:subClassOf rdf:Resource .
hpc:Fieldname rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Class .
hpc:Alias rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Fieldname .
hpc:Width rdfs:domain hpc:Fieldname ;
    rdfs:range xsd:nonNegativeInteger .
hpc:Unit rdfs:domain hpc:Fieldname ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .
hpc:Bhosts rdfs:domain hpc:Host ;
    rdfs:range rdf:Resource .


This ontology defines classes for Host, FieldName, and Alias, and properties for Width, Unit, and bhosts. The Host class is a subclass of rdf:Resource, while FieldName and Alias are subclasses of the Host class. The Width and Unit properties are datatype properties with domain FieldName and range xsd:nonNegativeInteger and xsd:string, respectively. The bhosts property is an object property with domain Host and range rdf:Resource.
